{"id":"c9314f62c1cc87b6","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-definable-wellorder.md","title":"ZFC Definable Wellorder","display":"df-zfc-definable-wellorder — ZFC Definable Wellorder","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-definable-wellorder","aliases":["58-df-zfc-definable-wellorder"],"display":"df-zfc-definable-wellorder — ZFC Definable Wellorder","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch20/58-df-well-order]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-definable-wellorder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-definable-wellorder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-definable-wellorder — ZFC Definable Wellorder"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" href=\"?note=1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-well-order\">../batch20/58-df-well-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula\">../batch17/58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment\">../batch03/58-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,X,\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\varphi,p\\in V\">\\(R,X,\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\varphi,p\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0,v_1,v_2\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(v_0,v_1,v_2\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> 为三个互异变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 见新增依赖。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WellOrder}\">\\(\\operatorname{WellOrder}\\)</span> 是载体在前的非严格良序谓词，保持原文件的序约定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\)</span> 使用 Satisfaction 文件给出的真值图关系缩写。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment\">../batch03/58-df-assignment</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DefinableWellorder}\">\\(\\mathrm{DefinableWellorder}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}definable\\text{-}wellorder}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DefinableWellorder}_S(R,X,\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\varphi,p)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land R\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\land\\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,R)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1,v_2\\}\n\\land p\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land s(v_0)=x\\land s(v_1)=y\\land s(v_2)=p\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\to\n\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}definable\\text{-}wellorder}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DefinableWellorder}_S(R,X,\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\varphi,p)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land R\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\land\\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,R)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1,v_2\\}\n\\land p\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land s(v_0)=x\\land s(v_1)=y\\land s(v_2)=p\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\to\n\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>六元调用接口不变。定义参数的三个变量以及其余变量不能影响真值的条件均在前两节给出；不再使用未绑定的赋值族。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-well-order","status":"resolved","id":"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-well-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b87